Package: ch.fso.pasta
Title: Versioned Long Format Time Series from CH.FSO.PASTA
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Open Time Series Initiative", , , "info@opentsi.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The ch.fso.pasta package provides versioned time series data
    and their meta information for scientific research.  In addition, the
    package contains the extract-transform-load (ETL) functionality that
    sources the data from its original provider, the Swiss Stats Explorer
    (stats.swiss) API of the Swiss Federal Statistical Office.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Imports: 
    digest,
    httr2,
    opentimeseries,
    utils,
    xml2
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
